  "constraints": [
    "-50 <= minTempC < maxTempC <= 50; 0 <= minHumidityPct < maxHumidityPct <= 100; toleranceMinutes >= 0.",
    "Snapshot of all four limits and tolerance when monitoring starts; no retroactive rewrite.",
    "plannedDeparture < estimatedArrival; weightTons > 0 and weightTons <= vehicle.capacityTons.",
    "Scheduling creates shipment and reservation atomically; active vehicle/driver reservations cannot overlap.",
    "Organization/resource permissions and assigned client must be checked by future server, never browser alone.",
    "DRAFT has no reservation; SCHEDULED -> IN_TRANSIT -> DELIVERED; cancellation from DRAFT/SCHEDULED releases resources (US34). TB1 API only permits scheduled cancellation; persisted DRAFT remains planned design.",
    "Acknowledgement preserves an open excursion. Thermal recovery requires a later valid reading in BOTH ranges; restoring communication only resolves a signal-loss alert.",
    "Communication gap uses configured maxSilenceMinutes. SignalRestored requires recent valid communication; stale readings do not demonstrate current recovery. Delivery stops monitoring; cancellation is only allowed before transit.",
    "Database relation design only. The supporting JSON API exists; this relational target does not claim executed migrations, PostgreSQL or a compiled UML artifact.",
    "Sensor is an independent Aggregate Root with ISensorRepository. It may exist without an assigned vehicle; vehicle_id is an optional identity reference, not Vehicle ownership.",
    "NotificationRead requires explicit action by the authorized recipient. ShipmentDelivered enables a report request; it does not generate the report automatically."
  ],
